@startuml KTOB_10_sequence_memory
title KTOB - AI Conversation Turn and Explicit Memory Approval
actor Reader
participant "Angular" as UI
participant "Spring API" as API
participant "Reader / Privacy" as Privacy
participant "Advisor" as Advisor
database "Supabase PostgreSQL" as DB
participant "AI adapter" as AI
Reader -> UI : Send text; choose spoilerLevel (NO_SPOILERS default)
UI -> API : POST /conversations/{id}/messages
API -> Privacy : verify JWT, owner, spoiler confirmation, AI processing opt-in
alt FULL_BOOK_SPOILERS without same-request confirmation
 Privacy --> API : SPOILER_CONFIRMATION_REQUIRED
 API --> UI : 422; no provider call or saved turn
else Spoiler policy valid
alt AI consent missing
 Privacy --> API : consent denied
API --> UI : 403 consent-required problem; no provider call
else Authorized
 Privacy --> Advisor : processing authorized
 Advisor -> Privacy : verify again at AI dispatch time
 alt Consent revoked
  Privacy --> API : consent revoked
API --> UI : 403; no persisted turn / call
 else Dispatch authorized
  Advisor -> AI : user text + allowed context + effective spoilerLevel
  alt Provider unavailable
   AI --> Advisor : timeout / unavailable
   Advisor --> API : provider unavailable
API --> UI : 503; no committed turn
  else Provider reply
   AI --> Advisor : reply + optional memory suggestions
   Advisor -> DB : atomically persist reader+assistant messages and pending proposals
   DB --> Advisor : saved turn
   Advisor --> API : ConversationTurn(userMessage, assistantMessage, proposalIds)
API --> UI : 201 ConversationTurn
  end
 end
end
end
opt Reader later reviews pending proposal
 Reader -> UI : Accept/edit OR dismiss
 UI -> API : POST /memory-proposals/{id}/decision
 API -> Privacy : verify proposal and source message ownership
 alt Approve
  API -> Advisor : approve exactly once
  Advisor -> DB : proposal=APPROVED, approved memory linked to proposal
 else Dismiss
  API -> Advisor : dismiss
  Advisor -> DB : proposal=DISMISSED
 end
end
note over Advisor,DB
NO_SPOILERS default; FULL_BOOK_SPOILERS requires one-turn confirmation.
For a NO_SPOILERS turn, older FULL_BOOK_SPOILERS history is filtered
or redacted from AI context (no accidental reuse).
Spoiler request does not change privacy consent or content boundaries.
Chats never silently create permanent approved memories.
Revocation via DELETE /memories/{id} is terminal.
end note
@enduml
